{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"plan\": \"大字沿着想靠近、怕露出、发现对方没退开、重新敢喜欢、又怕失去，走到不再往回藏；小字分组散在对应变化旁。前后照应“悬着／落稳”“水波／停住”“藏起来／不往回藏”，让亲近、甜、失重、松气、心口发疼各自留下短碎片。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"他忽然很想靠近对方，连自己都吓了一跳。\",\"keys\":[\"很想靠近\",\"吓了一跳\"],\"emotion\":\"炽热\",\"from\":[\"S01-1\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"猝不及防\",\"bead\":\"S01-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"两下响亮和弦\",\"bead\":\"S01-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"威尼斯的夏夜\",\"bead\":\"S01-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"像烟花冲上夜空\",\"bead\":\"S01-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"高高炸开\",\"bead\":\"S01-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"碎光慢慢飘落\",\"bead\":\"S01-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"还没落稳\",\"bead\":\"S01-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"悬在水面上\",\"bead\":\"S01-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"摇晃还没成形\",\"bead\":\"S01-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"怕对方觉得负担太重，他只敢露一点喜欢。\",\"keys\":[\"负担太重\",\"一点喜欢\"],\"emotion\":\"不安\",\"from\":[\"S01-2\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"刚踏上船板\",\"bead\":\"S01-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"木板微晃\",\"bead\":\"S01-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"脚下荡开水波\",\"bead\":\"S01-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"身体一晃\",\"bead\":\"S01-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"一瞬间失重\",\"bead\":\"S01-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"轻轻摇着\",\"bead\":\"S01-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"悬在半空\",\"bead\":\"S01-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"还没站稳\",\"bead\":\"S01-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"只是这一点亲近就很甜，他还不敢更坦白。\",\"keys\":[\"很甜\",\"不敢更坦白\"],\"emotion\":\"悬着\",\"from\":[\"S01-3\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"话还没出口\",\"bead\":\"S01-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"几秒沉默\",\"bead\":\"S01-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"想了很久\",\"bead\":\"S01-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"心里很清楚\",\"bead\":\"S01-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"关系会变\",\"bead\":\"S01-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"格外小心\",\"bead\":\"S01-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"}]}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"对方没有退开，还愿意亲近，他慢慢放松下来。\",\"keys\":[\"没有退开\",\"放松下来\"],\"emotion\":\"安心\",\"from\":[\"S02-1\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"像心跳\",\"bead\":\"S02-B2\",\"bars\":\"4–5\"},{\"text\":\"一下又一下\",\"bead\":\"S02-B2\",\"bars\":\"4–5\"},{\"text\":\"水浪不停\",\"bead\":\"S02-B2\",\"bars\":\"4–5\"},{\"text\":\"不必踩实地面\",\"bead\":\"S02-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"被小船托着\",\"bead\":\"S02-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"舒服地漂\",\"bead\":\"S02-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"不急着靠岸\",\"bead\":\"S02-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"水还在流\",\"bead\":\"S02-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"时间没停\",\"bead\":\"S02-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"两道声音贴紧\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"贴耳说悄悄话\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"肩挨着肩\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"呼吸都贴着\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"体温融在一起\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"安静坐着\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"不用找话说\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"偶尔对望\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"沉默也不尴尬\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"夏末的水面\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"潮潮的晚风\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"暖暖的\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"有点黏皮肤\",\"bead\":\"S02-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"轻轻落下\",\"bead\":\"S02-B4\",\"bars\":\"约7–11\"},{\"text\":\"像温柔的小刺\",\"bead\":\"S02-B4\",\"bars\":\"约7–11\"},{\"text\":\"甜甜的确认\",\"bead\":\"S02-B4\",\"bars\":\"约7–11\"},{\"text\":\"又甜又酸\",\"bead\":\"S02-B4\",\"bars\":\"约7–11\"},{\"text\":\"鼻子一酸\",\"bead\":\"S02-B4\",\"bars\":\"约7–11\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"眼前这么好\",\"bead\":\"S02-B4\",\"bars\":\"约7–11\"},{\"text\":\"还没失去\",\"bead\":\"S02-B4\",\"bars\":\"约7–11\"},{\"text\":\"先舍不得\",\"bead\":\"S02-B4\",\"bars\":\"约7–11\"},{\"text\":\"真想慢一点\",\"bead\":\"S02-B4\",\"bars\":\"约7–11\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"他喜欢得快藏不住，又怕太急，还是收住了。\",\"keys\":[\"快藏不住\",\"收住了\"],\"emotion\":\"炽热\",\"from\":[\"S02-2\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"忍不住往上涌\",\"bead\":\"S02-B3\",\"bars\":\"12–14\"},{\"text\":\"突然热切\",\"bead\":\"S02-B3\",\"bars\":\"12–14\"},{\"text\":\"连呼吸都变了\",\"bead\":\"S02-B3\",\"bars\":\"12–14\"},{\"text\":\"没冲到最热\",\"bead\":\"S02-B3\",\"bars\":\"14–16\"},{\"text\":\"轻轻吐口气\",\"bead\":\"S02-B3\",\"bars\":\"14–16\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"又软下来\",\"bead\":\"S02-B3\",\"bars\":\"14–16\"},{\"text\":\"才落稳一点\",\"bead\":\"S02-B3\",\"bars\":\"14–16\"},{\"text\":\"又飘起来\",\"bead\":\"S02-B3\",\"bars\":\"14–16\"},{\"text\":\"话没说尽\",\"bead\":\"S02-B3\",\"bars\":\"14–16\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"相处得越好，他越舍不得眼前这一刻过去。\",\"keys\":[\"越好\",\"舍不得\"],\"emotion\":\"不安\",\"from\":[\"S02-3\"]}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"他不想再猜以后，只想舒服地待在这份亲近里。\",\"keys\":[\"不想再猜\",\"舒服\"],\"emotion\":\"安心\",\"from\":[\"S03-1\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"歌声退远\",\"bead\":\"S03-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"水波一圈圈\",\"bead\":\"S03-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"哪儿也不去\",\"bead\":\"S03-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"还停在那句话里\",\"bead\":\"S03-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"有点陶醉\",\"bead\":\"S03-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"有点走神\",\"bead\":\"S03-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"沉默也舒服\",\"bead\":\"S03-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"人还在这里\",\"bead\":\"S03-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"心慢慢漂远\",\"bead\":\"S03-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"他想问对方是否也喜欢这样，却没想好怎么开口。\",\"keys\":[\"也喜欢\",\"没想好\"],\"emotion\":\"悬着\",\"from\":[\"S03-2\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"突然几下急声\",\"bead\":\"S03-B2\",\"bars\":\"约20–21\"},{\"text\":\"想说的念头\",\"bead\":\"S03-B2\",\"bars\":\"约20–21\"},{\"text\":\"只冒了一下头\",\"bead\":\"S03-B2\",\"bars\":\"约20–21\"},{\"text\":\"又沉回去\",\"bead\":\"S03-B2\",\"bars\":\"约20–21\"},{\"text\":\"没说出来\",\"bead\":\"S03-B2\",\"bars\":\"约20–21\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"水下有股暗流\",\"bead\":\"S03-B3\",\"bars\":\"约20–22\"},{\"text\":\"像被拖住\",\"bead\":\"S03-B3\",\"bars\":\"约20–22\"},{\"text\":\"绕来绕去\",\"bead\":\"S03-B3\",\"bars\":\"约20–22\"},{\"text\":\"卡在半路\",\"bead\":\"S03-B3\",\"bars\":\"约20–22\"},{\"text\":\"倒影被风吹碎\",\"bead\":\"S03-B3\",\"bars\":\"约20–22\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"水光乱晃\",\"bead\":\"S03-B3\",\"bars\":\"约20–22\"},{\"text\":\"脑子里一团乱\",\"bead\":\"S03-B3\",\"bars\":\"约20–22\"},{\"text\":\"心里打了结\",\"bead\":\"S03-B3\",\"bars\":\"约20–22\"},{\"text\":\"有点不顺\",\"bead\":\"S03-B3\",\"bars\":\"约20–22\"}]}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"熟悉的亲近又回来了，他想起上回没说的话。\",\"keys\":[\"又回来了\",\"没说的话\"],\"emotion\":\"亲密\",\"from\":[\"S04-1\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"歌声又回来\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"24\"},{\"text\":\"贴耳低语\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"呼吸挨得近\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"比上次更急\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"花样更细密\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"水面光斑\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"晃得睁不开眼\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"说着往事\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"语速变快\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"忍不住再说\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"折回来补几句\",\"bead\":\"S04-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"他几乎想全说出来，盼对方也喜欢这样坦白的他。\",\"keys\":[\"全说出来\",\"坦白\"],\"emotion\":\"炽热\",\"from\":[\"S04-2\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"轻轻握着手\",\"bead\":\"S04-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"握得更紧\",\"bead\":\"S04-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"下意识用力\",\"bead\":\"S04-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"还没弄懂怕什么\",\"bead\":\"S04-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"想抱得更紧\",\"bead\":\"S04-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"想抓住这一刻\",\"bead\":\"S04-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"越用力越晃\",\"bead\":\"S04-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"船里站不稳\",\"bead\":\"S04-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"甜得鼻子酸\",\"bead\":\"S04-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"挨得那么近\",\"bead\":\"S04-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"水却一直向前\",\"bead\":\"S04-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"一秒一秒过去\",\"bead\":\"S04-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"还没失去\",\"bead\":\"S04-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"已经舍不得\",\"bead\":\"S04-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"想多留一会儿\",\"bead\":\"S04-B4\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"最后一道金光\",\"bead\":\"S04-B2\",\"bars\":\"约32\"},{\"text\":\"亮得刺眼\",\"bead\":\"S04-B2\",\"bars\":\"约32\"},{\"text\":\"情绪烫得厉害\",\"bead\":\"S04-B2\",\"bars\":\"约32\"},{\"text\":\"喉咙发颤\",\"bead\":\"S04-B2\",\"bars\":\"约32\"},{\"text\":\"像要哽住\",\"bead\":\"S04-B2\",\"bars\":\"约32\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"高处悬着\",\"bead\":\"S04-B2\",\"bars\":\"约32\"},{\"text\":\"水波还推着走\",\"bead\":\"S04-B2\",\"bars\":\"约32\"},{\"text\":\"一下全打开\",\"bead\":\"S04-B2\",\"bars\":\"约32\"},{\"text\":\"又慢慢收弱\",\"bead\":\"S04-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"还没落稳\",\"bead\":\"S04-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"摇晃慢下来\",\"bead\":\"S04-B2\",\"bars\":\"34\"},{\"text\":\"话还在回响\",\"bead\":\"S04-B2\",\"bars\":\"34\"},{\"text\":\"人静下来\",\"bead\":\"S04-B2\",\"bars\":\"34\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"又怕说太多让对方为难，最后仍留了一些话。\",\"keys\":[\"怕说太多\",\"留了一些话\"],\"emotion\":\"不安\",\"from\":[\"S04-3\"]}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"他忘了收住喜欢，等察觉时，对方已经看出来了。\",\"keys\":[\"忘了收住\",\"看出来了\"],\"emotion\":\"悬着\",\"from\":[\"S05-1\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"想抱得很紧\",\"bead\":\"S05-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"想抓住当下\",\"bead\":\"S05-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"手慢慢松开\",\"bead\":\"S05-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"深吸一口气\",\"bead\":\"S05-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"攥紧的劲\",\"bead\":\"S05-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"终于退下去\",\"bead\":\"S05-B1\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"水波突然没了\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"摇晃也没了\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"脚下落空\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"没了托底\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"刚才还很丰满\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"声音一下变薄\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"只剩一条线\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"单薄\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"孤零零\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"漫无目的\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"在空中游走\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"飘在半空\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"时间也松了\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"小船漂进雾里\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"看不清前路\",\"bead\":\"S05-B2\",\"bars\":\"\"}]},\n        {\"kind\":\"line\",\"text\":\"他忽然连怎么相处都拿不准，怕对方嫌太黏。\",\"keys\":[\"拿不准\",\"嫌太黏\"],\"emotion\":\"不安\",\"from\":[\"S05-2\",\"S05-3\"]},\n        {\"kind\":\"feel\",\"items\":[{\"text\":\"贴耳说话\",\"bead\":\"S05-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"话突然断了\",\"bead\":\"S05-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"只剩自己\",\"bead\":\"S05-B3\",\"bars\":\"\"},{\"text\":\"跌回心里\",\"bead\":\"S05-B3\",\"ba